  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 9704.01 Grant Conditions",
  "priorExpiration": "2022-07-28",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 9704.01 Grant Conditions.\n\n(a) Grant funds awarded pursuant to the body-worn and dashboard camera fund shall support activities for encouraging local law enforcement agencies to equip officers with body-worn cameras and agency vehicles with dashboard cameras.\n\n(b) Grantees awarded funds under this chapter shall agree to maintain a program for the body-worn cameras or dashboard cameras for a minimum of 5 years from the official award date.\n\nSource. #13338, INTERIM, eff 1-29-22, EXPIRES: 7-28-22; ss by #13365, eff 4-18-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c9700.html"
